 natural way. The Mist Orb uses swirling water instead of filters to wash the air in your room, trapping dust, cooking smells, pet odors and stale air so the room smells clean again.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdd 2 to 3 drops of your favorite essential oil and it doubles as an aroma machine, filling your space with clean scent while it works. The soft 7-color LED glow makes it a warm accent light for kitchens, living rooms and desks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e💧 \u003cstrong\u003eWater-based filtration\u003c\/strong\u003e, no filters to replace, ever\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e🌿 \u003cstrong\u003eEssential oil compatible\u003c\/strong\u003e, purify and scent in one\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e🌙 \u003cstrong\u003e7-color LED glow\u003c\/strong\u003e, set the mood in any room\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e⚡ \u003cstrong\u003eLow power draw\u003c\/strong\u003e, runs on a standard US outlet\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e🧼 \u003cstrong\u003eEasy clean\u003c\/strong\u003e, rinse the bowl with warm water, refill, done\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompact enough for a kitchen counter. Enough for a whole room.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-07-21T03:25:45-04:00","created_at":"2026-07-21T03:25:44-04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-06T08:59:58-03:00","vendor":"Seagumi","product_type":"","tags":[],"variants":[{"id":50979146072287,"title":"Black","option1":"Black","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"50588487647455","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":false,"featured_image":{"id":50686798004447,"product_id":9450792681695,"position":10,"created_at":"2026-08-07T03:07:52-04:00","updated_at":"2026-08-07T03:07:54-04:00","alt":null,"width":2048,"height":2048,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0801\/8948\/9375\/files\/Water-based_Air_Purifier_Product_Photo.png?v=1786086474","variant_ids":[50979146072287]},"available":true,"price":"89.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":9450792681695,"created_at":"2